   "source": [
    "This plotting system is designed for magic hexagons whose six sides\n",
    "are not necessarily of equal length.\n",
    "\n",
    "In fact, Jisugquimundo can be regarded as a type of magic hexagon\n",
    "composed of triangular cells, in which the six sides may have\n",
    "arbitrary lengths."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
